  "description": "The Syncfusion® Essential PDF is a .NET standard PDF library that enables your .NET core applications to read, write, and manipulate existing PDF documents. It has various features such table creation, PDF form creation and filling, digital signature, and advanced PDF encryption.\n\t\t\n\t\tIt also has various PDF manipulation features such as PDF compression, redaction, split and merge PDF, watermark, import and export PDF form data, replace or remove images, extract text and find text.",
